      "locked": false,
      "text": "Make my trip \n\nV1:\nFlow:\n1> User comes to the website (current location, current time)\n2> Theaters (location , name, Screens )\n3> Screen will have (movie , time , duration , list[Seats - available or not ] )\nnow\n4> user comes to book \n5> list of near by screen shown to him (CONSTANT RADIOUS) - from which movies are available top (5)\n6> user can search also movie or theater \n7> user select a movie and select the screen and what time is available according to that \n8> user will select free seats \n9> gets a price there would be some lock \n10> payment strategy ( Netbanking , UPI , CARD)\n11> payment gets successfull release the lock and make it registered \n11> payment fails then wait for retry or exit which will release the lock \n12> user can cancel the booking (some charges will be charged and refunded)\n",
      "fontSize": 18.601593329231456,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Make my trip \n\nV1:\nFlow:\n1> User comes to the website (current location, current time)\n2> Theaters (location , name, Screens )\n3> Screen will have (movie , time , duration , list[Seats - available or not ] )\nnow\n4> user comes to book \n5> list of near by screen shown to him (CONSTANT RADIOUS) - from which movies are available top (5)\n6> user can search also movie or theater \n7> user select a movie and select the screen and what time is available according to that \n8> user will select free seats \n9> gets a price there would be some lock \n10> payment strategy ( Netbanking , UPI , CARD)\n11> payment gets successfull release the lock and make it registered \n11> payment fails then wait for retry or exit which will release the lock \n12> user can cancel the booking (some charges will be charged and refunded)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
